    "lawCode": "Amd §3, Chap 392 of 2003",
    "lawSection": "Sullivan County",
    "memo": " BILL NUMBER:  S4824\n\n TITLE OF BILL :\nAn act to amend chapter 392 of the laws of 2003 relating to creating\nthe Mamakating library district in the town of Mamakating, New York,\nin relation to changing the structure of the board of such library\ndistrict\n\n\n PURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL :\nTo authorize up to 15 trustees for the Mamakating Library District\nBoard.\n\n SUMMARY OF SPECIFIC PROVISIONS :\nAuthorizes the Trustees of the Mamakating Library District to increase\nby up to 10 (for a total of 15) the total number of Trustees of the\nLibrary District.\n\n EFFECTS OF PRESENT LAW WHICH THIS BILL WOULD ALTER :\nCurrently there are a total of five trustees of the Mamakating Library\nDistrict Board.\n\n JUSTIFICATION :\nThe Mamakating Library District Board has requested this legislation.\n\n LEGISLATIVE HISTORY :\nNew Bill.\n\n FISCAL IMPLICATIONS :\nNone.\n\n EFFECTIVE DATE :\nImmediately.\n",
